<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: we tried to be cheap -->
  <VME_CheapTradingFair.stages.we_tried_to_be_cheap.label>intentamos ser tacaños</VME_CheapTradingFair.stages.we_tried_to_be_cheap.label>
  <!-- EN: We tried to organize a trading fair without spending any money on it. It is shameful to be so cheap. -->
  <VME_CheapTradingFair.stages.we_tried_to_be_cheap.description>Intentamos organizar una feria comercial sin gastar dinero en ella. Es vergonzoso ser tan tacaño.</VME_CheapTradingFair.stages.we_tried_to_be_cheap.description>
  
  <!-- EN: poorly organized trading fair -->
  <VME_PoorlyOrganizedTradingFair.stages.poorly_organized_trading_fair.label>feria comercial mal organizada</VME_PoorlyOrganizedTradingFair.stages.poorly_organized_trading_fair.label>
  <!-- EN: With such a low quality effort, no additional caravans will be attracted to our settlement... -->
  <VME_PoorlyOrganizedTradingFair.stages.poorly_organized_trading_fair.description>Con un esfuerzo de tan baja calidad, no se atraerán caravanas adicionales a nuestro asentamiento...</VME_PoorlyOrganizedTradingFair.stages.poorly_organized_trading_fair.description>
  
  <!-- EN: unexciting trading fair -->
  <VME_UnexcitingTradingFair.stages.unexciting_trading_fair.label>feria comercial poco emocionante</VME_UnexcitingTradingFair.stages.unexciting_trading_fair.label>
  <!-- EN: Some exciting transactions took place, but the majority of it was boring business talk. -->
  <VME_UnexcitingTradingFair.stages.unexciting_trading_fair.description>Tuvieron lugar algunas transacciones emocionantes, pero la mayoría fue una aburrida charla de negocios.</VME_UnexcitingTradingFair.stages.unexciting_trading_fair.description>
  
  <!-- EN: well organized trading fair -->
  <VME_WellOrganizedTradingFair.stages.well_organized_trading_fair.label>feria comercial bien organizada</VME_WellOrganizedTradingFair.stages.well_organized_trading_fair.label>
  <!-- EN: There was a lot of back and forth and networking. -->
  <VME_WellOrganizedTradingFair.stages.well_organized_trading_fair.description>Hubo mucho intercambio y creación de redes.</VME_WellOrganizedTradingFair.stages.well_organized_trading_fair.description>
  
  <!-- EN: wondrous trading fair -->
  <VME_WondrousTradingFair.stages.wondrous_trading_fair.label>feria comercial maravillosa</VME_WondrousTradingFair.stages.wondrous_trading_fair.label>
  <!-- EN: We discussed exciting and innovative economical paradigms, and our settlement will be renowned as a center of finance learning. -->
  <VME_WondrousTradingFair.stages.wondrous_trading_fair.description>Discutimos paradigmas económicos emocionantes e innovadores, y nuestro asentamiento será reconocido como un centro de aprendizaje financiero.</VME_WondrousTradingFair.stages.wondrous_trading_fair.description>
  
